{"Exit code documentation mismatch: The update-compatibility guide documents exit code 1 as covering cases where the metadata file is missing/corrupted, but the implementation throws PropertyException for missing/unreadable files, which Picocli maps to exit code 2 (usage error). This causes automation using the documented exit code meanings to mis-handle file-not-found/unreadable-metadata failures.": 0.13664844632148743}